# Required String Validation Rule

For required text fields, keep empty values as `""` and validate safely with `(value ?? "").trim()`.

Avoid calling `.trim()` on maybe-undefined values.

```tsx
// ✅ Good
if (!(form.name ?? "").trim()) {
  errors.name = "Name is required.";
}

// ❌ Bad
if (!form.name.trim()) {
  errors.name = "Name is required.";
}
```
